  "subject": "Webda.io - Password recovery",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<head>\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n<title>Webda.io - Password recovery</title>\n<link href=\"styles.css\" media=\"all\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n<style>\n@font-face {\n  font-family: 'Roboto';\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  font-stretch: normal;\n  src: url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/roboto/v51/KFOMCnqEu92Fr1ME7kSn66aGLdTylUAMQXC89YmC2DPNWubEbVmUiA8.ttf) format('truetype');\n}\n\n</style>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"http://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"EmailMessage\",\n  \"potentialAction\": {\n    \"@type\": \"ConfirmAction\",\n    \"name\": \"Update Password\",\n    \"handler\":  {\n       \"@type\": \"HttpActionHandler\",\n       \"url\": \"http://webda.io/recovery_form.html?token=tok&amp;&lt;1&gt;&#39;&expire=1700000000000&login=o&#39;neil@x.io\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n</script>\n</head>\n\n<body itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/EmailMessage\">\n\n<table class=\"body-wrap\">\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<td></td>\n\t\t<td class=\"container\" width=\"600\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t<table class=\"main\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"alert header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr class=\"firstline\" valign=\"bottom\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td><img src=\"http://webda.io/images/logo.png\"></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"title\">Webda<span class=\"orange\">.io</span> - Password Recovery</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"content-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"content-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThis is a verification email to replace the password of your account, if you haven't started this process simpliy ignore this email.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"content-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThis is the default email template from Webda.io, you should customize it by adding a template named PASSPORT_EMAIL_RECOVERY\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"content-block\" align=\"right\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://webda.io/recovery_form.html?token=tok&amp;&lt;1&gt;&#39;&expire=1700000000000&login=o&#39;neil@x.io\" class=\"btn-primary\">Update my password</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"100%\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td class=\"aligncenter content-block\">Take a look at <a href=\"http://webda.io\">webda.io</a></td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t</td>\n\t\t<td></td>\n\t</tr>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n",
  "text": "This is a verification email to replace the password of your account, if you haven't started this process simpliy ignore this email.\n\nThis is the default email template from Webda.io, you should customize it by adding a template named PASSPORT_EMAIL_RECOVERY\n\nLink: http://webda.io/recovery_form.html?token=tok&amp;&lt;1&gt;&#39;&expire=1700000000000&login=o&#39;neil@x.io"
